---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for translateGoals. Interpret broad educational goals as observable project evidence and identify prerequisite skills. Separate the project’s fictional or practical theme from the competencies it must exercise, and preserve constraints on resources and learner workload. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
